API.md M5, API.md M6 (review probe zz3_nest_both, 2026-10-13): what the edit writes is a fixed point and
changes no byte outside the items it re-prints, a settle that joins an enclosing item included.
Here: a nested `[ ]` list narrowed by a Set joins, and so does the list holding it.
